lly from her profile around toward a three-quarter front angle. She raises the pistol and settles into a composed two-handed aim, both arms fully extended out toward something off-frame to her right, her body in clean profile and her expression cool and still — the poised aim held clearly and steadily. She holds the line for a beat, chin level, then fires a single shot: the muzzle flashes hard and bright, the slide kicks back, a spent brass casing flicks out and spins away through the air, thin smoke curling around the weapon, her expression sharpening with the recoil as the pistol jolts up in her gloved hands. The camera settles on a tighter three-quarter angle of her face and the smoking raised weapon on the final frame.\n\noverall_soundscape: A tense, near-silent ambience of a large echoing concrete space with only a faint low room hum and the woman's slow controlled breathing, a long hard natural reverb hanging on the bare walls. The space stays deliberately quiet and sparse around her steady aim and her single decisive shot, with no competing sound layered over the moment the weapon is fired.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A single low sustained synth bass note holds a very slow tense pulse, dropping out completely to leave pure quiet at the instant of the shot, then returning low underneath and holding into the final frame."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [403.1758728027344, 662.0624389648438], "pos": [-1741.2923583984375, 1785.518310546875], "id": 28, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"value": true}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [{"name": "SIGMAS", "links": [31], "label": "SIGMAS", "type": "SIGMAS", "